(6027937, 883980, 67258, '<td valign="top">Not sure that the tilt necessarily adds anything, but I do like the lighting and set-up.</td>', 'Not sure that the tilt necessarily adds anything, but I do like the lighting and set-up.', '2010-05-26 08:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6027942, 884632, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.</td>', 'Beautifully done.', '2010-05-26 08:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6027945, 885696, 67258, '<td valign="top">The galvanised look to the back ground suits your subject and title, but I find the composition somewhat uninteresting.</td>', 'The galvanised look to the back ground suits your subject and title, but I find the composition somewhat uninteresting.', '2010-05-26 08:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6027950, 886086, 67258, '<td valign="top">Shame about the smudge in the sky - I think thta if thta is sensor dust it is legal to clone it out, even in basic.  Nonetheless, a good photo.</td>', 'Shame about the smudge in the sky - I think thta if thta is sensor dust it is legal to clone it out, even in basic.  Nonetheless, a good photo.', '2010-05-26 08:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6027955, 886004, 67258, '<td valign="top">The artwork isn''t my cup of tea, but I think the photo very well done! 7.</td>', 'The artwork isn''t my cup of tea, but I think the photo very well done! 7.', '2010-05-26 08:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6027956, 885395, 99263, '<td valign="top">Any mate of Jack is a mate of mine :)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=826066" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1103/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_826066.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1103/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_826066.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1103/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_826066.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Any mate of Jack is a mate of mine :)', '2010-05-26 08:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6027972, 886118, 67258, '<td valign="top">An interesting OOB take on the cahllenge.  I like the set-up of the photo, but feel there is something m,issing - perhaps it is the lighting, or the white balance?  Or perhaps it is the sense of mourning that the photo gives me?  Not sure - and not much help to you, I''m afraid!</td>', 'An interesting OOB take on the cahllenge.  I like the set-up of the photo, but feel there is something m,issing - perhaps it is the lighting, or the white balance?  Or perhaps it is the sense of mourning that the photo gives me?  Not sure - and not much help to you, I''m afraid!', '2010-05-26 08:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6027973, 886117, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, and thoroughly pleasing photo.</td>', 'Excellent composition, and thoroughly pleasing photo.', '2010-05-26 08:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6027981, 885978, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I like the middle one.  I started making a quilt for my daughter 7 years ago and am still less than a quarter way finished...<br/> <br/>As to the photo, I like the use of the woodland and branch, but the colours do seem a little too saturated for my tastes - a little blinding!</td>', 'Ooh, I like the middle one.  I started making a quilt for my daughter 7 years ago and am still less than a quarter way finished... As to the photo, I like the use of the woodland and branch, but the colours do seem a little too saturated for my tastes - a little blinding!', '2010-05-26 08:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6027986, 886163, 51747, '<td valign="top">Great idea Paul. The dust is not an attribute here I''m afraid. Unless you had titled it  something like ''put away for too long''  something along those lines. But that doesn''t help now. The light is pretty sweet</td>', 'Great idea Paul. The dust is not an attribute here I''m afraid. Unless you had titled it  something like ''put away for too long''  something along those lines. But that doesn''t help now. The light is pretty sweet', '2010-05-26 08:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6027987, 885888, 114969, '<td valign="top">Great photo! I love the background color choice, it works so well with the outfit''s red. Fantastic model too :)</td>', 'Great photo! I love the background color choice, it works so well with the outfit''s red. Fantastic model too :)', '2010-05-26 08:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028059, 885584, 2780, '<td valign="top">If this wasn''t almost the same (but not as well done) as a photo currently on the homepage I might have given it an extra mark</td>', 'If this wasn''t almost the same (but not as well done) as a photo currently on the homepage I might have given it an extra mark', '2010-05-26 09:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028063, 885773, 2780, '<td valign="top">Its a photo competition, not a painting competition.</td>', 'Its a photo competition, not a painting competition.', '2010-05-26 09:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028068, 885560, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super composition, pleasing lighting.  Not so sure about the purple under the table.</td>', 'Super composition, pleasing lighting.  Not so sure about the purple under the table.', '2010-05-26 09:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028071, 886141, 2780, '<td valign="top">The contrast is very flat for a B&amp;W, but the idea behind the picture is good :)</td>', 'The contrast is very flat for a B&W, but the idea behind the picture is good :)', '2010-05-26 09:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028075, 886119, 67258, '<td valign="top">There seems to be something strange going on with the texture of the skin on the face - possibly as a result of noise reduction software, or perhaps just artefacting from JPEG compression.  I feel the photo would be improved hugely by greater distance of subject from background.</td>', 'There seems to be something strange going on with the texture of the skin on the face - possibly as a result of noise reduction software, or perhaps just artefacting from JPEG compression.  I feel the photo would be improved hugely by greater distance of subject from background.', '2010-05-26 09:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028079, 884732, 67258, '<td valign="top">I remember doing this with wire when I was young - completely forgotten about til now!  Not sure it makes for a particularly interesting photo - its just sort of ''there''.  Did you consider strong side-lighting to try and cast shadows of the patterns on the board?</td>', 'I remember doing this with wire when I was young - completely forgotten about til now!  Not sure it makes for a particularly interesting photo - its just sort of ''there''.  Did you consider strong side-lighting to try and cast shadows of the patterns on the board?', '2010-05-26 09:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028087, 886104, 67258, '<td valign="top">I suspect my tastebuds would be thoroughly confused eating these - at first look I really did think you had piled spaghetti into muffin cases!  As for the photograph, very well done, and the inclusion of the hand grating the parmesan (please tell me it isn''t really cheese on the cakes...) adds good context and balance.</td>', 'I suspect my tastebuds would be thoroughly confused eating these - at first look I really did think you had piled spaghetti into muffin cases!  As for the photograph, very well done, and the inclusion of the hand grating the parmesan (please tell me it isn''t really cheese on the cakes...) adds good context and balance.', '2010-05-26 09:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028088, 885444, 2780, '<td valign="top">Wow, impressive!</td>', 'Wow, impressive!', '2010-05-26 09:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028105, 885360, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a great idea.  Those toe shoes look brand new. :)</td>', 'What a great idea.  Those toe shoes look brand new. :)', '2010-05-26 09:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028107, 885472, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the Dali mustache!!  This is excellent.</td>', 'Love the Dali mustache!!  This is excellent.', '2010-05-26 09:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028110, 885731, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really love the photo and adore that ring. :)</td>', 'I really love the photo and adore that ring. :)', '2010-05-26 09:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028112, 886151, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the shape of a hollow body!!</td>', 'I love the shape of a hollow body!!', '2010-05-26 09:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028114, 885791, 15711, '<td valign="top">This looks like a photo I''d see in Country Living or a quilting catalog. :)</td>', 'This looks like a photo I''d see in Country Living or a quilting catalog. :)', '2010-05-26 09:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6028116, 885625, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love hand thrown pottery!! Those are lovely.</td>', 'I love hand thrown pottery!! Those are lovely.', '2010-05-26 09:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
