(6028355, 885918, 114969, '<td valign="top">Pianos are nice instruments. However, I don''t like the lighting here: I am missing all the cold tones that one can usually see here. Moreover, the white light just draws my attention too much, instead of being attracted by the piano itself my eyes keep returning to it. I probably would have moved it out of the picture''s frame, and also used some reflector on the other side to avoid harsh shadows.</td>', 'Pianos are nice instruments. However, I don''t like the lighting here: I am missing all the cold tones that one can usually see here. Moreover, the white light just draws my attention too much, instead of being attracted by the piano itself my eyes keep returning to it. I probably would have moved it out of the picture''s frame, and also used some reflector on the other side to avoid harsh shadows.', '2010-05-26 11:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
