(6028812, 886063, 16106, '<td valign="top">Well lit, believable and appropriate subject and nice busy frame full of art. One quibble, you posed the subject as if he were in the act of painting, and the unloaded brush and a pallet that has none of the colors of the painting makes it clear that he is not doing any such thing. The lie sort of diminished the photograph for me. Posed in front of his work, fine. Faking it well, fine. But why make such a false gesture in what is otherwise such a nice shot?</td>', 'Well lit, believable and appropriate subject and nice busy frame full of art. One quibble, you posed the subject as if he were in the act of painting, and the unloaded brush and a pallet that has none of the colors of the painting makes it clear that he is not doing any such thing. The lie sort of diminished the photograph for me. Posed in front of his work, fine. Faking it well, fine. But why make such a false gesture in what is otherwise such a nice shot?', '2010-05-26 16:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
