(6030157, 884003, 16106, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, and an great POV. the only thing that keeps this from a ten is the blown highlights on the can and hand. Never the less its my pick for blue.</td>', 'Clever idea, and an great POV. the only thing that keeps this from a ten is the blown highlights on the can and hand. Never the less its my pick for blue.', '2010-05-27 19:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6030158, 885368, 16106, '<td valign="top">I''m really torn on how to score this image, It is a truly lovely photograph, that seems to have nothing to do with the challenge. ill skip it for now and see if I gather some clarity later.<br/> <br/>Later...there are so many images that dont respond to the challenge as I see it Im giving up on dnmc. great image.8</td>', 'I''m really torn on how to score this image, It is a truly lovely photograph, that seems to have nothing to do with the challenge. ill skip it for now and see if I gather some clarity later. Later...there are so many images that dont respond to the challenge as I see it Im giving up on dnmc. great image.8', '2010-05-27 19:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6030159, 885696, 16106, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image of a tool, well lit and beautifully processed to bring up the tones and textures; But it is a tool, one that one might use to make art, but not a thing that I can believe you have made, nor is it art in any sense. if you had this tool hanging on a peice of sculpture, then full marks, but displayed on a painted background with no touch of the torch to be seen? I''ll return to vote later because I''m finding lots of pictures without art as a subject, but this one is very well done, but I have no idea how to score it.</td>', 'This is a lovely image of a tool, well lit and beautifully processed to bring up the tones and textures; But it is a tool, one that one might use to make art, but not a thing that I can believe you have made, nor is it art in any sense. if you had this tool hanging on a peice of sculpture, then full marks, but displayed on a painted background with no touch of the torch to be seen? I''ll return to vote later because I''m finding lots of pictures without art as a subject, but this one is very well done, but I have no idea how to score it.', '2010-05-27 19:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6030161, 885360, 16106, '<td valign="top">the framing is perfect here with a delicate lighting that suits the subject very well. I hope you will spot edit out those annoying bits of fluff above the key guard after the challenge.</td>', 'the framing is perfect here with a delicate lighting that suits the subject very well. I hope you will spot edit out those annoying bits of fluff above the key guard after the challenge.', '2010-05-27 20:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6030962, 885622, 39679, '<td valign="top">I''m not normally a fan of the "swirly light" long exposures but your''s is appropriate and nicely done.</td>', 'I''m not normally a fan of the "swirly light" long exposures but your''s is appropriate and nicely done.', '2010-05-28 16:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6030965, 885824, 39679, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot but I find the hand distracting.  The reflection, alone, is really interesting.</td>', 'I really like this shot but I find the hand distracting.  The reflection, alone, is really interesting.', '2010-05-28 16:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6030968, 884835, 39679, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  I really like the attention you used to make sure the spools were lined up and the pins were at the same angle.  That said, it looks like the thimble is a little out of focus.  Still, a very nice shot</td>', 'I like this shot.  I really like the attention you used to make sure the spools were lined up and the pins were at the same angle.  That said, it looks like the thimble is a little out of focus.  Still, a very nice shot', '2010-05-28 16:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6030971, 885779, 39679, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The brick wall and lighting you used really invokes the feeling of a jazz club.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The brick wall and lighting you used really invokes the feeling of a jazz club.', '2010-05-28 16:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6030977, 886129, 39679, '<td valign="top">Yay Cannon beach.  <br/> <br/>This is a really nice shot and well balanced.</td>', 'Yay Cannon beach.   This is a really nice shot and well balanced.', '2010-05-28 16:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031009, 884538, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stopped me dead in my tracks.  Stunning capture and wonderful origami (not to mention bokeh!)</td>', 'Stopped me dead in my tracks.  Stunning capture and wonderful origami (not to mention bokeh!)', '2010-05-28 17:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031012, 885973, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very clever and well done.</td>', 'Very clever and well done.', '2010-05-28 17:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031013, 886073, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely high key.</td>', 'Lovely high key.', '2010-05-28 17:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031016, 886103, 96751, '<td valign="top">The art for is stunning.  The capture a bit "snap-shot" for my taste.</td>', 'The art for is stunning.  The capture a bit "snap-shot" for my taste.', '2010-05-28 17:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031018, 885982, 96751, '<td valign="top">The upper hand position is a bit awkward in this otherwise terrific low key shot.  I wonder if mirroring the bottom hand would have been more pleasing, visually.</td>', 'The upper hand position is a bit awkward in this otherwise terrific low key shot.  I wonder if mirroring the bottom hand would have been more pleasing, visually.', '2010-05-28 17:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031188, 885566, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really cool idea! I think this could have benefitted from a bit sharper focus.</td>', 'Really cool idea! I think this could have benefitted from a bit sharper focus.', '2010-05-28 21:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031189, 886064, 114225, '<td valign="top">I feel this image is trying to be simple and complex at the same time. I wonder if I would have liked it a bit better without the jar of colored pencils.</td>', 'I feel this image is trying to be simple and complex at the same time. I wonder if I would have liked it a bit better without the jar of colored pencils.', '2010-05-28 21:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031190, 886157, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective used, and black and white was a good choice for this one.</td>', 'I like the perspective used, and black and white was a good choice for this one.', '2010-05-28 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031193, 885584, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fun lighting painting. One thing that I don''t like is how many of the brush heads blend into the background. Makes it feel like something is missing.</td>', 'Fun lighting painting. One thing that I don''t like is how many of the brush heads blend into the background. Makes it feel like something is missing.', '2010-05-28 21:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031194, 885972, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool take on the challenge..</td>', 'Very cool take on the challenge..', '2010-05-28 21:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031195, 885850, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great perspective used. I like the DOF, but at the same time wish it was slightly larger to see more of the sketch.</td>', 'Great perspective used. I like the DOF, but at the same time wish it was slightly larger to see more of the sketch.', '2010-05-28 22:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031196, 885789, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty cool hobby. Perfect setting to show off your craft.</td>', 'That''s a pretty cool hobby. Perfect setting to show off your craft.', '2010-05-28 22:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6031197, 886141, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, was that really drawn on an etch-a-sketch? That''s amazing!</td>', 'Wow, was that really drawn on an etch-a-sketch? That''s amazing!', '2010-05-28 22:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
